{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_928.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f48ea673927c79adb862ca88c9572b601338252f427d25773f559f70128aae39","ja":"ええ。未来ちゃんと桃子ちゃんの\n意見も聞かせてほしくって。","zh":"嗯。我也想听听未来和桃子的\n意见。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_928.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"9846fbd84889c051b51e2cc78508c4ccbd1fcb424f3e0e9ef545ee3a691f94c2","ja":"ふうん……たくさんあるんだね。\nたしかに迷っちゃいそう。","zh":"唔……有好多呢。\n确实会让人挑花眼呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_928.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0d6dbd19a790dcd3024a6ff9bef2291948879619eda5128e9c6ca772e6590156","ja":"じゃあ私たちが公演先で食べて、\nおいしかったのを注文するのはどうですか！？","zh":"那不如点我们在演出地点吃过、觉得好吃的东西吧！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_928.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"94235a8c8e33ad3a75430310095c28e7543ed68ff522ae4d1b8ef506824fce9b","ja":"うん、それいいと思うな。\n桃子のオススメは、長崎のカステラかな♪","zh":"嗯，我觉得那挺好的。\n桃子的推荐是长崎蛋糕吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_928.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"9fbb931cabef02eb54f70480c75cbbefcb28ad3027d259cb4a2a0dd3f438f646","ja":"あっ。そういえば、品切れで買えなかったけど\nあの酒造の焼酎……お取り寄せなら……？","zh":"啊。话说回来，那家酒厂的烧酒因为断货没买到……要是能邮购的话……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_928.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"1db35a5897d1c659186412a7b6b1ee17a32357924ab342084fc7e6cfba11da93","ja":"ショーチュー……チャーシューの\n親戚ですか？　私も食べてみたいな～♪","zh":"烧猪……是叉烧的\n亲戚吗？我也想尝尝看～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_928.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"7b9663bd0e1847288ae12d1461d4648437e5abd5cd1b26a4dc47bbc2249116b0","ja":"あっ、ご、ごめんなさい！　これは、\n未来ちゃん達にはちょっと早かったわね。","zh":"啊，对、对不起！　这个，\n对小未来她们来说还有点太早了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_928.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"d4f53da067bbf3cbde37c5e54019a34ebe730005d5880d606d9548488f60b8e0","ja":"商品の名前はなかなか思い出せないかもね。\n焦ることないし、ゆっくり選べばいいんじゃない？","zh":"商品的名字可能一时想不起来呢。\n不用着急，慢慢选不就好了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_928.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"a3cb58cfe8bd3a6b118032df6985db70992f71718ef503775168ab82d38e616b","ja":"それもそっか。私もおいしかったもの、\nちゃんと思い出しておきますね！","zh":"说得也是呢。我也会好好记住那些好吃的东西，\n好好记住的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_928.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"6c4af1e031342abc6f6c41d0097b2ce8d75da277b0cff6258f19080062accb28","ja":"ええ、そうしましょう。","zh":"好的，就这么办吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_928.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1621259c1b9a88f6b7228ee41efb2b4a94abe51bf9db8cc098c5523f982a8a84","ja":"（品切れだった焼酎は、個人的に注文して……\r\nこのみさん達との飲み会に、持っていこうっと♪）","zh":"（那款卖断货的烧酒，我私下订了……\n带去和此美她们的酒会吧♪）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
